{"product_id":"complete-idiots-guide-to-religions-online-complete-idiots-guide","title":"Complete Idiot's Guide to Religions Online (Complete Idiot's Guide)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Complete Idiot's Guide to Online Religion gives you key information about all the groups who are not Christian, marginally Christian or four-square Christian. It provides a road map for finding trustworthy data, exciting visual sites and new textual resources for almost any religious tradition worthy of the name. That is, if it--or one of its members--has discovered the WWW. Most have and The Complete Idiot's Guide to Online Religion makes it easier to find what you need, or want, to know about religion, spirituality and God than any other Web companion now available. And if your interest is \"solely\" to find a soul-mate, someone who shares your spiritual outlook, and with whom you would like to share info, or explore a new relationship, that option too is provided. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Bruce Lawrence \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780789722096 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 380\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44968441839769,"sku":"14RG9780789722096","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/8ff90474c01498bea5238d5ac3495a6e.jpg?v=1732002729","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/complete-idiots-guide-to-religions-online-complete-idiots-guide","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}